flowchart TB
  dsh[Install DeepSeek Harness 0.2.1–0.2.x<br/>npm install -g @deepseek-ai/dsh] --> route{Choose install route}
  route -->|Web UI| web[Plugins → Add plugin<br/>github:raktim-mondol/academic-harness]
  route -->|CLI profile| cli[dsh plugin --profile academic-harness add<br/>github:raktim-mondol/academic-harness]
  web --> first[Start the first Academic Harness chat]
  cli --> first

  first --> setup[Background runtime setup on first preset mount]
  setup --> zg[zvec-grep<br/>npm install + zg server on]
  setup --> pm[PaperMemory<br/>vendored venv + stdio MCP]
  setup --> tf[TextFold<br/>pinned Python runtime]
  setup --> ah[Writing engine<br/>plugin-local venv]

  first --> preset{Preset selector reads<br/>Academic Harness?}
  preset -->|yes| ready[Ready: search, papers, writing, reviews]
  preset -->|no| fix[Restart dsh and start a new chat<br/>the preset mounts once per process]
  fix --> ready
  ready --> keys[Optional: Settings → Academic Harness API keys]

  zg -. fail-soft .-> ready
  pm -. fail-loud .-> ready
  tf -. first call waits .-> ready
  ah -. first ah_* call waits .-> ready

  classDef step fill:#eef2ff,stroke:#6366f1,color:#312e81
  classDef optional fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#f97316,color:#7c2d12
  classDef decision fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#10b981,color:#064e3b
  class dsh,web,cli,first,setup,ready step
  class keys optional
  class route,preset decision
